<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25793" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασᾰφ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make quite clear, show plainly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπίδας οὔσας κενάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					398
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				916e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.13O.
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. εἴτε . . εἴτε μή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					348b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				5.13
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. περί τινος</span>
			<i>make a clear statement</i> about . ., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				404b1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. εἰς Καρχηδόνα περί τινος</span>”
				<i>send clear information . .,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.87.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὑπέρ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.19.13
				</span></i>
			; <i>instruct plainly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.26.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ma.</u>
				1.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PEleph.</u>
					18.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>:—
				Med.
			, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPar.</u>
				70p.413
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1094b12
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
